# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.0.1] - 2025-11-12

### Added

* Docker environment for compiling linux, ldds and busybox. Also for launching qemu
* Scripts for building linux, busybox, initramfs, devicetree, extract qemu devicetree, etc.
* platform driver example to be used with device tree interaction
